#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""pc-control — LLM-friendly desktop control for Linux (KDE/GNOME/wlroots, Wayland or X11).

Screenshots come from the compositor (spectacle/grim/gnome-screenshot/...);
mouse and keyboard injection comes from ydotool (uinput), which games receive
like a physical device.

Every command prints exactly one compact JSON object on stdout and exits 0 on
success or 1 on failure. Screenshot coordinates are accepted in the pixel space
of the most recent screenshot (which may be downscaled); the helper maps them
back to native pixels automatically.
"""

